#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit) - Released June 2025\n"
